<title>SOUTH KOREA: Mando Machinery 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Mando Machinery 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		   6,226    vs    8,735</p>
<p>    Net Profit		  30.69    vs    39.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,277.39    vs 1,150.54</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 37.45    vs    47.97</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	 0.77    vs    16.73</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	    common stocks     16.5     vs     13.0</p>
<p>	    preferred stocks  17.5     vs     14.0</p>
<p>    Dividend Payment		April 10</p>
<p>    Dividend Register	     December 31</p>
<p>Note - Mando Machinery Corp is a member firm of the Halla Group. A company official said the profit fall was due to a large extraordinary gain in 1995, when it sold a factory valued at 17.3 billion won.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
